Traditional flow:

Developers code freely

CI/CD runs builds

QA or Security teams find issues late

Fixes are costly and time-consuming

With Shift Left:

Developers get immediate feedback (via linters, scanners, or policy engines)

Security, compliance, and quality become part of coding itself

CI/CD pipelines reject unsafe or non-compliant changes before merge/deploy

